  "zh": "Python生态又双叒扩张：EVE Online宣布全面迁移至Python 3；加州立法者一致通过Linux免于年龄验证法，开源社区喜大普奔；CPython正式支持RISC-V架构，国产芯片生态再进一步；腾讯发布Hy4预览，内存计算成芯片新战场。西藏泥石流已致16人死亡500余人失联，救援工作紧张进行；开学季“三件套”齐涨价，家长钱包遭暴击；敌敌畏消杀事件6人被刑拘，食品安全底线不能碰；南极冰川融化惊现剧毒水银释放，气候危机再响警报。习近平赴上合峰会，中国元首外交忙不停；梅艳芳母亲去世，香港一代歌后家人终得安宁。",
  "en": "Python 3 migration accelerates as EVE Online joins the ecosystem; California unanimously exempts Linux from age-verification law, open source wins; CPython officially supports RISC-V architecture, boosting domestic chip ecosystem; Tencent releases Hy4 preview, in-memory computing emerges as new battleground. Tibet landslide death toll rises to 16 with 500+ missing, rescue efforts intensifying; Back-to-school costs surge as parents feel the pinch; Six arrested for using toxic pesticide in food supply chain, food safety crackdown; Antarctic glaciers melting release toxic mercury, climate crisis escalates. Chinese President Xi attends SCO summit, diplomacy in full swing; Anita Mui's mother passes away, closing a chapter for Hong Kong's legendary singer."
